# ContactModal — Web3Forms access key (free, no signup).
#
# How to get one:
#   1. Go to https://web3forms.com/
#   2. Enter `kiamorakirby@gmail.com` (where you want the messages
#      delivered) and click "Create your Access Key".
#   3. Web3Forms emails you a UUID-ish key.
#
# Then create `.env.local` (NOT this file — `.env.local` is git-ignored
# by Next.js default) and add:
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=your-actual-key-here
#
# The key is intentionally public — Web3Forms scopes each one to the
# email that requested it, so even if a visitor snags it from the
# bundle they can only send mail to YOU. Rebuild + redeploy to pick
# up the change (Next bakes `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` vars into the static
# bundle at build time).
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
